# Human-verification reviewer workbooks (ta_triage_review_B/C.xlsx) contain abstracts and
# stay git-ignored by the deny-all rule above; only the manifest + instructions + merge
# outputs are tracked.
!04_screening/formal_*/ai_triage/review_workbooks_manifest.json
!04_screening/formal_*/ai_triage/README_review_workbooks.md
